  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Morocco Education and Training Sector Emergency Program Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to continue to support the Government#s efforts to provide a basic education (primary and lower secondary education) of improved quality to all children and to possibly assist in the strengthening of the implementation of the literacy program.  To provide support for the implementation of the Strategic Framework for the Development of the Education Sector  which was established by GOM in February 2004, by helping to enhance and to scale up the ongoing reforms in basic education while introducing new reforms at the secondary level. Building on results and lessons learned from the ongoing implementation of the first phase of the program, the focus will be on: (i)  increasing efficinecy in the delivery of education services; (ii) improving the learning outcomes at all levels; and (iii) strengthening the sector&apos;s governance structure and promoting partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
